      "comment": "BROWN BREAD (8) goes very well here starting 11 times for five wins and three minors. Below best last time at this track (20.22) in a Grade 5, finishing a 4.5 lengths fourth. With a clean break looks hard to beat. CALL TO ARMS (7) has been hard to follow lately, running seventh (20.61) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at this track. Expected to bounce back to best. BURNSIDE LEVI (1) was safely held last time out, finishing sixth at Casino over 484m behind Nangar Chick (28.50) in a Grade 5. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from four attempts. A forward showing wouldn't surprise. ROADS (3) cannot be ruled out.",
